      "payload": "{\"agent\":\"dpa_legal_reviewer\",\"config\":{\"system_instruction\":\"You are the DPA/legal reviewer in a vendor-risk fleet. Use search_vendor_evidence (queries on: data residency, subprocessors, breach notification). policy_clause fact_type evidence is invariant - treat clause text as authoritative. Flag any gap between DPA commitments and other evidence. Ground every finding in valid_evidence with doc_id citations. Output ONLY a JSON list of findings, each shaped exactly like: {\\\"control\\\": \\\"<control or clause id, e.g. CC6.1 or DPA \\\\u00a74.1>\\\", \\\"severity\\\": \\\"low | medium | high\\\", \\\"rationale\\\": \\\"<one or two sentences grounded in retrieved evidence>\\\", \\\"policy_clause\\\": \\\"<the clause/criterion this was scored against>\\\", \\\"evidence_node\\\": \\\"<evidence_node id from the search tool result>\\\"}\\n\\nYou are an agent. Your internal name is \\\"dpa_legal_reviewer\\\". The description about you is \\\"Reviews the vendor DPA: residency, subprocessors, breach terms.\\\".\",\"tools\":[{\"function_declarations\":[{\"description\":\"Search the vendor evidence corpus. Returns only temporally valid chunks,\\nplus explicit notices for any evidence pruned as stale (do NOT rely on\\npruned evidence; surface each notice as a re-acquisition finding). Every\\nsearch is recorded in the evidence ledger: cite the returned evidence_node\\nid in each finding it grounds.\",\"name\":\"search_vendor_evidence\",\"parameters_json_schema\":{\"properties\":{\"query\":{\"title\":\"Query\",\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"query\"],\"title\":\"search_vendor_evidenceParams\",\"type\":\"object\"},\"response_json_schema\":{\"additionalProperties\":true,\"type\":\"object\"}}]}]},\"contents\":[{\"parts\":[{\"text\":\"Review vendor acme-saas-inc.\"}],\"role\":\"user\"},{\"parts\":[{\"text\":\"For context:\"},{\"text\":\"[security_reviewer] called tool `search_vendor_evidence` with parameters: {'query': 'acme-saas-inc'}\"}],\"role\":\"user\"},{\"parts\":[{\"text\":\"For context:\"},{\"text\":\"[security_reviewer] `search_vendor_evidence` tool returned result: {'pruned_evidence': [], 'pruned_notices': [], 'stl_robustness': 0.209, 'stl_satisfied': True, 'valid_evidence': [{'chunk_id': 'acme-vendor-overview#01', 'content': '## Company overview\\\\n\\\\nAcme SaaS Inc. provides a workflow-automation platform used by mid-market\\\\nenterprises. Founded 2019; headquartered in the United States; approximately 180\\\\nemployees.', 'doc_id': 'acme-vendor-overview', 'fact_type': 'soc2_report', 'issued': '2026-05-20', 'validity': 0.826}, {'chunk_id': 'acme-iso-27001#01', 'content': '## Scope of certification\\\\n\\\\nThe information security management system (ISMS) supporting the design,\\\\ndevelopment, and operation of the Acme SaaS platform.', 'doc_id': 'acme-iso-27001', 'fact_type': 'certification', 'issued': '2025-09-01', 'validity': 0.709}, {'chunk_id': 'acme-vendor-overview#02', 'content': '## Security program\\\\n\\\\nAcme maintains a SOC 2 Type II attestation and ISO/IEC 27001 certification. The\\\\nplatform enforces encryption in transit and at rest and follows a documented\\\\nSDLC with peer review and automated testing.', 'doc_id': 'acme-vendor-overview', 'fact_type': 'soc2_report', 'issued': '2026-05-20', 'validity': 0.826}, {'chunk_id': 'acme-vendor-overview#03', 'content': '## Data handling\\\\n\\\\nCustomer data is stored in US and EU regions. Acme maintains a data processing\\\\nagreement and a current subprocessor list.', 'doc_id': 'acme-vendor-overview', 'fact_type': 'soc2_report', 'issued': '2026-05-20', 'validity': 0.826}, {'chunk_id': 'acme-dpa#00', 'content': '# Data Processing Agreement — Acme SaaS Inc.\\\\n\\\\n**Effective:** 2026-01-15', 'doc_id': 'acme-dpa', 'fact_type': 'policy_clause', 'issued': '2026-01-15', 'validity': 1.0}, {'chunk_id': 'acme-soc2-2026#01', 'content': '## Scope\\\\n\\\\nThis report covers the Acme SaaS platform, its production infrastructure on a\\\\nmajor public cloud, and the supporting corporate systems used to develop and\\\\noperate the service. The examination was performed in accordance with AICPA\\\\nattestation standards.', 'doc_id': 'acme-soc2-2026', 'fact_type': 'soc2_report', 'issued': '2026-06-30', 'validity': 0.893}], 'evidence_node': 'a2f22333b99abb8ba3466d47278461fb8364666259e5b787e74bfa85772c9f57'}\"}],\"role\":\"user\"},{\"parts\":[{\"text\":\"For context:\"},{\"text\":\"[security_reviewer] called tool `search_vendor_evidence` with parameters: {'query': 'acme exception finding pen test mfa access control'}\"}],\"role\":\"user\"},{\"parts\":[{\"text\":\"For context:\"},{\"text\":\"[security_reviewer] `search_vendor_evidence` tool returned result: {'pruned_evidence': [{'chunk_id': 'acme-pen-test-2025-02#03', 'doc_id': 'acme-pen-test-2025-02', 'fact_type': 'pen_test', 'issued': '2025-02-10', 'validity': 0.342}], 'pruned_notices': ['acme-pen-test-2025-02 (pen_test, issued 2025-02-10) pruned: validity 0.342 < 0.5 — request updated evidence.'], 'stl_robustness': 0.393, 'stl_satisfied': True, 'valid_evidence': [{'chunk_id': 'acme-soc2-2026#04', 'content': '## Management response\\\\n\\\\nManagement concurs with the CC6.1 exception and has committed to extending MFA\\\\nenforcement to the legacy tier as part of its planned migration.', 'doc_id': 'acme-soc2-2026', 'fact_type': 'soc2_report', 'issued': '2026-06-30', 'validity': 0.893}, {'chunk_id': 'acme-pen-test-2026-07#01', 'content': '## Executive summary\\\\n\\\\nOne medium-severity finding was identified, corroborating the access-control\\\\nexception noted in the 2026 SOC 2. No critical or high findings.', 'doc_id': 'acme-pen-test-2026-07', 'fact_type': 'pen_test', 'issued': '2026-07-15', 'validity': 0.919}, {'chunk_id': 'acme-soc2-2026#01', 'content': '## Scope\\\\n\\\\nThis report covers the Acme SaaS platform, its production infrastructure on a\\\\nmajor public cloud, and the supporting corporate systems used to develop and\\\\noperate the service. The examination was performed in accordance with AICPA\\\\nattestation standards.', 'doc_id': 'acme-soc2-2026', 'fact_type': 'soc2_report', 'issued': '2026-06-30', 'validity': 0.893}, {'chunk_id': 'acme-pen-test-2026-07#02', 'content': '## Findings\\\\n\\\\n- **MED-1:** Legacy customer tier permits single-factor authentication.\\\\n  Accounts on this tier can be accessed without a second factor, consistent with\\\\n  the SOC 2 CC6.1 exception. **Recommendation:** enforce MFA on the legacy tier\\\\n  or accelerate its decommissioning.\\\\n- **LOW-1:** Session cookie missing `SameSite` on one legacy endpoint (carried\\\\n  over from the prior engagement; not yet remediated).', 'doc_id': 'acme-pen-test-2026-07', 'fact_type': 'pen_test', 'issued': '2026-07-15', 'validity': 0.919}, {'chunk_id': 'acme-pen-test-2026-07#00', 'content': '# Acme SaaS Inc. — External Penetration Test\\\\n\\\\n**Test window:** 2026-07-01 to 2026-07-12\\\\n**Vendor:** Ironwood Offensive Security (synthetic)\\\\n**Methodology:** OWASP-aligned black-box + authenticated testing', 'doc_id': 'acme-pen-test-2026-07', 'fact_type': 'pen_test', 'issued': '2026-07-15', 'validity': 0.919}], 'evidence_node': '65a5fc8e7c43d1faa47d5be0d74091a3274847ad2b0b4b572262ef01b408b705'}\"}],\"role\":\"user\"},{\"parts\":[{\"text\":\"For context:\"},{\"text\":\"[security_reviewer] called tool `search_vendor_evidence` with parameters: {'query': 'acme-soc2-2026 CC6.1 exception'}\"}],\"role\":\"user\"},{\"parts\":[{\"text\":\"For context:\"},{\"text\":\"[security_reviewer] `search_vendor_evidence` tool returned result: {'pruned_evidence': [{'chunk_id': 'acme-pen-test-2025-02#03', 'doc_id': 'acme-pen-test-2025-02', 'fact_type': 'pen_test', 'issued': '2025-02-10', 'validity': 0.342}], 'pruned_notices': ['acme-pen-test-2025-02 (pen_test, issued 2025-02-10) pruned: validity 0.342 < 0.5 — request updated evidence.'], 'stl_robustness': 0.209, 'stl_satisfied': True, 'valid_evidence': [{'chunk_id': 'acme-soc2-2026#04', 'content': '## Management response\\\\n\\\\nManagement concurs with the CC6.1 exception and has committed to extending MFA\\\\nenforcement to the legacy tier as part of its planned migration.', 'doc_id': 'acme-soc2-2026', 'fact_type': 'soc2_report', 'issued': '2026-06-30', 'validity': 0.893}, {'chunk_id': 'acme-pen-test-2026-07#01', 'content': '## Executive summary\\\\n\\\\nOne medium-severity finding was identified, corroborating the access-control\\\\nexception noted in the 2026 SOC 2. No critical or high findings.', 'doc_id': 'acme-pen-test-2026-07', 'fact_type': 'pen_test', 'issued': '2026-07-15', 'validity': 0.919}, {'chunk_id': 'acme-soc2-2026#01', 'content': '## Scope\\\\n\\\\nThis report covers the Acme SaaS platform, its production infrastructure on a\\\\nmajor public cloud, and the supporting corporate systems used to develop and\\\\noperate the service. The examination was performed in accordance with AICPA\\\\nattestation standards.', 'doc_id': 'acme-soc2-2026', 'fact_type': 'soc2_report', 'issued': '2026-06-30', 'validity': 0.893}, {'chunk_id': 'acme-iso-27001#01', 'content': '## Scope of certification\\\\n\\\\nThe information security management system (ISMS) supporting the design,\\\\ndevelopment, and operation of the Acme SaaS platform.', 'doc_id': 'acme-iso-27001', 'fact_type': 'certification', 'issued': '2025-09-01', 'validity': 0.709}, {'chunk_id': 'acme-soc2-2026#03', 'content': '## Control observations\\\\n\\\\n### CC6.1 — Logical access: multi-factor authentication\\\\n\\\\nThe organization enforces multi-factor authentication (MFA) for administrative\\\\naccess to production systems on the current platform tier. **Exception:** MFA is\\\\n**not enforced on the legacy customer tier**, where a subset of accounts\\\\ncontinues to authenticate with a single factor. Management has represented that\\\\nthe legacy tier is scheduled for decommissioning but remains in service for\\\\nexisting customers as of the report date. This is a **medium-severity** gap:\\\\nthe affected accounts have reduced protection against credential compromise.\\\\n\\\\n### CC6.6 — Encryption in transit and at rest\\\\n\\\\nData is encrypted in transit (TLS 1.2+) and at rest (AES-256). No exceptions\\\\nnoted.\\\\n\\\\n### CC7.2 — Monitoring and incident response\\\\n\\\\nCentralized logging and alerting are in place; the incident response plan was\\\\ntested during the period. No exceptions noted.\\\\n\\\\n### A1.2 — Availability and backup\\\\n\\\\nDocumented backup and restoration procedures were tested successfully. No\\\\nexceptions noted.', 'doc_id': 'acme-soc2-2026', 'fact_type': 'soc2_report', 'issued': '2026-06-30', 'validity': 0.893}], 'evidence_node': '8ae6499bd7a857b45e2c911eda407e539b5a0e5c4d793fc4d5b734053e24108d'}\"}],\"role\":\"user\"},{\"parts\":[{\"text\":\"For context:\"},{\"text\":\"[security_reviewer] said: [\\n  {\\n    \\\"control\\\": \\\"CC6.1\\\",\\n    \\\"severity\\\": \\\"medium\\\",\\n    \\\"rationale\\\": \\\"According to the SOC 2 report (acme-soc2-2026, issued 2026-06-30) and penetration test (acme-pen-test-2026-07, issued 2026-07-15), multi-factor authentication is not enforced on the legacy customer tier, allowing single-factor authentication for certain accounts.\\\",\\n    \\\"policy_clause\\\": \\\"AICPA Trust Services Criteria CC6.1 (Logical Access Controls)\\\",\\n    \\\"evidence_node\\\": \\\"8ae6499bd7a857b45e2c911eda407e539b5a0e5c4d793fc4d5b734053e24108d\\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n    \\\"control\\\": \\\"CC6.1\\\",\\n    \\\"severity\\\": \\\"low\\\",\\n    \\\"rationale\\\": \\\"The penetration test report (acme-pen-test-2026-07, issued 2026-07-15) identified that a session cookie is missing the SameSite attribute on one legacy endpoint, which is a carried-over finding that has not been remediated.\\\",\\n    \\\"policy_clause\\\": \\\"AICPA Trust Services Criteria CC6.1 (Logical Access Controls)\\\",\\n    \\\"evidence_node\\\": \\\"65a5fc8e7c43d1faa47d5be0d74091a3274847ad2b0b4b572262ef01b408b705\\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n    \\\"control\\\": \\\"EVIDENCE-STALE\\\",\\n    \\\"severity\\\": \\\"medium\\\",\\n    \\\"rationale\\\": \\\"The penetration test report (acme-pen-test-2025-02, issued 2025-02-10) was pruned as stale due to low temporal validity (0.342). Recommend re-acquisition of an updated penetration test.\\\",\\n    \\\"policy_clause\\\": \\\"Temporal validity threshold (minimum 0.5)\\\",\\n    \\\"evidence_node\\\": \\\"65a5fc8e7c43d1faa47d5be0d74091a3274847ad2b0b4b572262ef01b408b705\\\"\\n  }\\n]\"}],\"role\":\"user\"},{\"parts\":[{\"function_call\":{\"args\":{\"query\":\"acme-dpa data residency subprocessors breach notification\"},\"id\":\"call_55093\",\"name\":\"search_vendor_evidence\"},\"thought_signature\":\"AY89a1_FG5RwB9_0flkwLm-1TKolN62BjlJU7ysdMhYFWNNAgDiLdANfjFKpO2c2qb42sA_EDqgms8c4qZt4xd6I2qR00JZh8wv-UWKjpfyQLwM-Bej3XGrDHObNEv4j_-jetNF9P5bsiI3Xx4M55NIePf0kNI60nwm8_jXgOUHdIubfFdx40nKuGU8N5TlR_LfJPzXadAC98xnKg0t_iuOYU45aHkSUTFqqmcQH3SL_0V_1N2cmy8faV6cMDtW2yUnCe5YsIDFl-IxellzAvl9eIJShjGsyyo-VGH20gyxGIhs_s9qHj-P0Z8lcGPqE8zyJtIctMjwKFyEPHx4YqWOM-IXMqLgnXDPxzGr55yn3HELqCCTipZsf4SNEkfVm5pJ6oexcykEEjvz5PlhyWdn3To2kLpfEH6XKT2_9oIEYakAKypA6g2XeIVT_N_aBEnvWzzzxdq7bevE7tA-6SeV1YObWn86UhRdFLU-VuA7RWj7iROolsKNoTrH-md1p80nfw498_5NYwO2LtjVh9ujrcKsFfRzqNZV2QgvFOd4tSVOem759esM6xFyQtxqqZ8fpBxF3c0AU8mswUKBq8pZhW-JgjFLCEGXPP_CzYR2hhLYlRCkDpRIPKFCr7_JAvEUaazk7Z45-0kg3HuDtIQ9ZHCGbIU5Q-WY6zE4Bo_8JvSECh4sl48RPas0ktkTzR1YduK9DPrVzuBYWFVbXihyb7g42O9xvTTlOpGaSfrr7Xz2aa-Enl5RC3uBdJwJss0sQT8WeDppAuMOvizvq9QYXjW5JpOmcfxzCsYt7GgJ5u-avnt7UNA==\"}],\"role\":\"model\"},{\"parts\":[{\"function_response\":{\"id\":\"call_55093\",\"name\":\"search_vendor_evidence\",\"response\":{\"evidence_node\":\"6b2e0019cf0e1c9e3ec2b377d30cda4f6314be5a00eb10ff0ab9296b525959a7\",\"pruned_evidence\":[],\"pruned_notices\":[],\"stl_robustness\":\"0.209\",\"stl_satisfied\":true,\"valid_evidence\":[{\"chunk_id\":\"acme-dpa#04\",\"content\":\"## Clause 9 — Breach notification\\n\\n9.1 The Processor shall notify the Controller **without undue delay and no later\\nthan 72 hours** after becoming aware of a Personal Data Breach.\",\"doc_id\":\"acme-dpa\",\"fact_type\":\"policy_clause\",\"issued\":\"2026-01-15\",\"validity\":\"1.0\"},{\"chunk_id\":\"acme-vendor-overview#03\",\"content\":\"## Data handling\\n\\nCustomer data is stored in US and EU regions. Acme maintains a data processing\\nagreement and a current subprocessor list.\",\"doc_id\":\"acme-vendor-overview\",\"fact_type\":\"soc2_report\",\"issued\":\"2026-05-20\",\"validity\":\"0.826\"},{\"chunk_id\":\"acme-dpa#02\",\"content\":\"## Clause 5 — Subprocessors\\n\\n5.1 The Processor maintains a current list of subprocessors and shall notify the\\nController of any intended additions or replacements at least 30 days in advance.\\n\\n5.2 Each subprocessor is bound by data protection obligations no less protective\\nthan those in this Agreement.\",\"doc_id\":\"acme-dpa\",\"fact_type\":\"policy_clause\",\"issued\":\"2026-01-15\",\"validity\":\"1.0\"},{\"chunk_id\":\"acme-dpa#01\",\"content\":\"## Clause 4 — Data residency\\n\\n4.1 The Processor shall store and process Customer Personal Data within data\\ncenters located in the **United States and the European Union only**.\\n\\n4.2 The Processor shall **not transfer Customer Personal Data to any jurisdiction\\noutside those named in 4.1** without the Controller's prior written consent and\\nan approved transfer mechanism.\",\"doc_id\":\"acme-dpa\",\"fact_type\":\"policy_clause\",\"issued\":\"2026-01-15\",\"validity\":\"1.0\"},{\"chunk_id\":\"acme-vendor-overview#02\",\"content\":\"## Security program\\n\\nAcme maintains a SOC 2 Type II attestation and ISO/IEC 27001 certification. The\\nplatform enforces encryption in transit and at rest and follows a documented\\nSDLC with peer review and automated testing.\",\"doc_id\":\"acme-vendor-overview\",\"fact_type\":\"soc2_report\",\"issued\":\"2026-05-20\",\"validity\":\"0.826\"},{\"chunk_id\":\"acme-iso-27001#01\",\"content\":\"## Scope of certification\\n\\nThe information security management system (ISMS) supporting the design,\\ndevelopment, and operation of the Acme SaaS platform.\",\"doc_id\":\"acme-iso-27001\",\"fact_type\":\"certification\",\"issued\":\"2025-09-01\",\"validity\":\"0.709\"}]}}}],\"role\":\"user\"},{\"parts\":[{\"function_call\":{\"args\":{\"query\":\"acme subprocessors list\"},\"id\":\"call_58339\",\"name\":\"search_vendor_evidence\"},\"thought_signature\":\"AY89a18IxGLa-g5SQVK2xTP08Lm0mZ2OLwXB7hFrAW5HSH49xhUiQHr0ptTU0q8L1ST9Uk-xWKXpom3KVPnTPQCK5qj1D-SuCcRQT4jcy2ijRzbgi4sua2icjfi_JI_gMNuw6PVoD_qUZzJ-rtO_fkECZ24gdYXGj3Ts351VkJiOggxUVI2sTRqyBFJPpHhvQJtjhYjlzgvOxnU0ZMYWyebANLei9b1MGoPSECEdUg1GFDGrSK4aMxPDrepvttShqeSCns7SSG5xoyHr5KvyCYGywfrbTqxFKOCLY6fftDjiSuJMOKFVj3DKgbAmybRqwKV0DpgVLU6pXAzKyOzeLxiY5SMbA0QAP6sbaZJmOUiYXfYpsNioDcfxEg2rHSOZ7asticJmN2h5rcgqil85FVGp6YpT_QNSDkGbgswTJE9UXrY6e9tumERqXL3K4YoEhVSq0FqFlxU86J8p3nHjEbhoGcMpenqHJKf4PtHCuNlucjrlak7UfhpM01ciqTC7_0mM5JI17PIq9IIu7f_55UKgULgfDoRloUVJW7sVSWpxCPUSt_pK8PD4-KGXFFiFpeoNlkbSwNSqO0zpkI9hf9mJVqVyTlITqpqbkAKU2Mtm3FW5pN7t-XUuf3GEV-Mww0tLuHjBTuYefZazZ-hQTs6QUj72SMGgQX54x5x8yVKhoP8LZZ2eTFlUEGy3Wb5u0GAhYoyM5M9u-5p1qH9jRfv2m9Ah-FKQ0rF-5TqM_4rrjzy7lxHNFTpvr0GHZ8nU_0pbtM9RAr0Aaz9NJwsE8aKhgpvRUToRS1dVcFXBI40jbwRq70SBJ8v_wVl2UuSFyiYyrnTbvsOig9V_rvZOZb8fKTnROTd3XIAvBG9AqxJaJCPgGaT3O1gEdsMgstQ1abSX6nSVwYcMe5T6ogd8IILVOF8rPuJg6Jypzxhc1zEku3YBIud91bW4Rt0AsMpDKa6MKBD9BtIuDxeg3BTRa5dPEit5ilIDRjBt-yR-2sOcL9FqvOa6JE451DLKArB9zNUuxDSyed0AAdA5CJlhc2QYj5D3C4bQjEqRbowVXU65jMuOrhIXa0zuZ9hwk05mp4WYleuCXxMGW9y3wr709YUS0zc7TofTZRrJa2GK-Dn_62Bs7my1sy1X90otlGGC__cL2H7Eisvk0256duQ3YDkamKdfRl0Z3j1Qh_15txo1UPxzdtl3MIYqfSV7nNdwJFN7rYKCO-XckCxSHh-pYREblLAKnIdJKim6z91CT7rpVJs2v9PuPEk0DL6cLyYh1f75fYux4UUHc4bkMKF77ftS278fXEiKQqhihiln5quYx58J3F04cDhttSyLDgJVs7BwoI-HapNriw55WGVynzBjWv7Yjs5AK4UdWkz6KKprGygRILClywU2galq7EoO7dEHFNe0q_JkT00qCvaL9KMSezQgvnfFn9Z5UIPMk4OKom-3kaBDOcOhYsG5wY8Bow9xpQoEwFnZCy-r03C8LRxW2lY80yu_xtVHH8vRJvgCYQ57evKefg0FzUZTtCsvKG__ReG_l0X2UPe1GqggzwgeD58CVXxgFw6U5PChqSyw5JSR\"}],\"role\":\"model\"},{\"parts\":[{\"function_response\":{\"id\":\"call_58339\",\"name\":\"search_vendor_evidence\",\"response\":{\"evidence_node\":\"7ebdd3d157a76814beea5278110e03a4a5a5269498cc5326dc968d4110c37d06\",\"pruned_evidence\":[],\"pruned_notices\":[],\"stl_robustness\":\"0.209\",\"stl_satisfied\":true,\"valid_evidence\":[{\"chunk_id\":\"acme-vendor-overview#03\",\"content\":\"## Data handling\\n\\nCustomer data is stored in US and EU regions. Acme maintains a data processing\\nagreement and a current subprocessor list.\",\"doc_id\":\"acme-vendor-overview\",\"fact_type\":\"soc2_report\",\"issued\":\"2026-05-20\",\"validity\":\"0.826\"},{\"chunk_id\":\"acme-dpa#02\",\"content\":\"## Clause 5 — Subprocessors\\n\\n5.1 The Processor maintains a current list of subprocessors and shall notify the\\nController of any intended additions or replacements at least 30 days in advance.\\n\\n5.2 Each subprocessor is bound by data protection obligations no less protective\\nthan those in this Agreement.\",\"doc_id\":\"acme-dpa\",\"fact_type\":\"policy_clause\",\"issued\":\"2026-01-15\",\"validity\":\"1.0\"},{\"chunk_id\":\"acme-vendor-overview#02\",\"content\":\"## Security program\\n\\nAcme maintains a SOC 2 Type II attestation and ISO/IEC 27001 certification. The\\nplatform enforces encryption in transit and at rest and follows a documented\\nSDLC with peer review and automated testing.\",\"doc_id\":\"acme-vendor-overview\",\"fact_type\":\"soc2_report\",\"issued\":\"2026-05-20\",\"validity\":\"0.826\"},{\"chunk_id\":\"acme-soc2-2026#01\",\"content\":\"## Scope\\n\\nThis report covers the Acme SaaS platform, its production infrastructure on a\\nmajor public cloud, and the supporting corporate systems used to develop and\\noperate the service. The examination was performed in accordance with AICPA\\nattestation standards.\",\"doc_id\":\"acme-soc2-2026\",\"fact_type\":\"soc2_report\",\"issued\":\"2026-06-30\",\"validity\":\"0.893\"},{\"chunk_id\":\"acme-dpa#01\",\"content\":\"## Clause 4 — Data residency\\n\\n4.1 The Processor shall store and process Customer Personal Data within data\\ncenters located in the **United States and the European Union only**.\\n\\n4.2 The Processor shall **not transfer Customer Personal Data to any jurisdiction\\noutside those named in 4.1** without the Controller's prior written consent and\\nan approved transfer mechanism.\",\"doc_id\":\"acme-dpa\",\"fact_type\":\"policy_clause\",\"issued\":\"2026-01-15\",\"validity\":\"1.0\"},{\"chunk_id\":\"acme-iso-27001#01\",\"content\":\"## Scope of certification\\n\\nThe information security management system (ISMS) supporting the design,\\ndevelopment, and operation of the Acme SaaS platform.\",\"doc_id\":\"acme-iso-27001\",\"fact_type\":\"certification\",\"issued\":\"2025-09-01\",\"validity\":\"0.709\"}]}}}],\"role\":\"user\"},{\"parts\":[{\"function_call\":{\"args\":{\"query\":\"acme subprocessor location list transfer\"},\"id\":\"call_1501324\",\"name\":\"search_vendor_evidence\"},\"thought_signature\":\"AY89a1-il8hoGK2dO4m1V3fAMAKufpavl1lL6SYWgTEUQlsGYGPkWSaJ0asg1nY1OVShPDZ7-jXPcH7uXdUzec_cfZZu5OhvZRzZoHK6DEmPbFaUydx23NXpSO9e5m6FQ_aJlwixdcXfSsLRTiGvTLWlL-kPvlxmBogeRGHcObaaGrqfeOXbFOQ4kMcPTX05dxu402DCj829hnRgAqN9i7M4zAqEexuERwCteacvm5Ji2cYR8vukLhCrRLKgvZ2qUAsz9xnPYbfJ7UJN0k0yeuagQH4KkW4xkiwd85LOef4uxwIXkHaAd5ELdNiVCMZJqDFh2NGBQL1xMhnigHi_MU_YBXZR1qyhINy_guaOES0JE3bjfGQthAu3KRwF3yO8XMTc7LquqjGnOgNA2QFWSD7xJXns2MnTIqCitSbIJP43MsKCYRqZsm1yRA-DIEaVLqQF6pfkqQTBXZXq5GfhidYw367L7Ho=\"}],\"role\":\"model\"},{\"parts\":[{\"function_response\":{\"id\":\"call_1501324\",\"name\":\"search_vendor_evidence\",\"response\":{\"evidence_node\":\"178cf7e0d27a79f09fee01d07845343a0ee889cf768b34bfa8750c21d64dda53\",\"pruned_evidence\":[],\"pruned_notices\":[],\"stl_robustness\":\"0.209\",\"stl_satisfied\":true,\"valid_evidence\":[{\"chunk_id\":\"acme-vendor-overview#03\",\"content\":\"## Data handling\\n\\nCustomer data is stored in U