":\"acme-dpa\",\"fact_type\":\"policy_clause\",\"issued\":\"2026-01-15\",\"validity\":\"1.0\"},{\"chunk_id\":\"acme-vendor-overview#02\",\"content\":\"## Security program\\n\\nAcme maintains a SOC 2 Type II attestation and ISO/IEC 27001 certification. The\\nplatform enforces encryption in transit and at rest and follows a documented\\nSDLC with peer review and automated testing.\",\"doc_id\":\"acme-vendor-overview\",\"fact_type\":\"soc2_report\",\"issued\":\"2026-05-20\",\"validity\":\"0.826\"},{\"chunk_id\":\"acme-iso-27001#01\",\"content\":\"## Scope of certification\\n\\nThe information security management system (ISMS) supporting the design,\\ndevelopment, and operation of the Acme SaaS platform.\",\"doc_id\":\"acme-iso-27001\",\"fact_type\":\"certification\",\"issued\":\"2025-09-01\",\"validity\":\"0.709\"},{\"chunk_id\":\"acme-dpa#00\",\"content\":\"# Data Processing Agreement — Acme SaaS Inc.\\n\\n**Effective:** 2026-01-15\",\"doc_id\":\"acme-dpa\",\"fact_type\":\"policy_clause\",\"issued\":\"2026-01-15\",\"validity\":\"1.0\"},{\"chunk_id\":\"acme-soc2-2026#01\",\"content\":\"## Scope\\n\\nThis report covers the Acme SaaS platform, its production infrastructure on a\\nmajor public cloud, and the supporting corporate systems used to develop and\\noperate the service. The examination was performed in accordance with AICPA\\nattestation standards.\",\"doc_id\":\"acme-soc2-2026\",\"fact_type\":\"soc2_report\",\"issued\":\"2026-06-30\",\"validity\":\"0.893\"}]}}}],\"role\":\"user\"},{\"parts\":[{\"function_call\":{\"args\":{\"query\":\"subprocessor\"},\"id\":\"call_57220\",\"name\":\"search_vendor_evidence\"},\"thought_signature\":\"AY89a1-9k3E33cWTewke6QKLDCIx0RiY_HOGr4jAiN6I8qzEmaeH9fksQQUN-Dr3MbTB2yKRwlUNbvMT61Qo8IG4XTDbX28cKhj5VsuXQDceeXXtwj8QvA5pA2x1-QQ6EnTZeNw7M9RBOOqy1obhcfSLqoSwTKllfq5fZEO-vRc-QwDqKVRLuYx3eiMKegfw4WJzsBicClOpBUd8W9DDxzYFjYL0n6drS8_kgCHOnzsc2Bd-X5Dq6B4bY--TPOEpOCw=\"}],\"role\":\"model\"},{\"parts\":[{\"function_response\":{\"id\":\"call_57220\",\"name\":\"search_vendor_evidence\",\"response\":{\"evidence_node\":\"2ba973da75451f1cb89ecd894e2779da5eab4f36b6ba8e487fc74964c6a40913\",\"pruned_evidence\":[],\"pruned_notices\":[],\"stl_robustness\":\"0.326\",\"stl_satisfied\":true,\"valid_evidence\":[{\"chunk_id\":\"acme-dpa#02\",\"content\":\"## Clause 5 — Subprocessors\\n\\n5.1 The Processor maintains a current list of subprocessors and shall notify the\\nController of any intended additions or replacements at least 30 days in advance.\\n\\n5.2 Each subprocessor is bound by data protection obligations no less protective\\nthan those in this Agreement.\",\"doc_id\":\"acme-dpa\",\"fact_type\":\"policy_clause\",\"issued\":\"2026-01-15\",\"validity\":\"1.0\"},{\"chunk_id\":\"acme-dpa#01\",\"content\":\"## Clause 4 — Data residency\\n\\n4.1 The Processor shall store and process Customer Personal Data within data\\ncenters located in the **United States and the European Union only**.\\n\\n4.2 The Processor shall **not transfer Customer Personal Data to any jurisdiction\\noutside those named in 4.1** without the Controller's prior written consent and\\nan approved transfer mechanism.\",\"doc_id\":\"acme-dpa\",\"fact_type\":\"policy_clause\",\"issued\":\"2026-01-15\",\"validity\":\"1.0\"},{\"chunk_id\":\"acme-vendor-overview#03\",\"content\":\"## Data handling\\n\\nCustomer data is stored in US and EU regions. Acme maintains a data processing\\nagreement and a current subprocessor list.\",\"doc_id\":\"acme-vendor-overview\",\"fact_type\":\"soc2_report\",\"issued\":\"2026-05-20\",\"validity\":\"0.826\"},{\"chunk_id\":\"acme-dpa#03\",\"content\":\"## Clause 7 — Security measures\\n\\n7.1 The Processor shall implement appropriate technical and organizational\\nmeasures, including encryption of Personal Data in transit and at rest, and\\naccess controls enforcing least privilege.\",\"doc_id\":\"acme-dpa\",\"fact_type\":\"policy_clause\",\"issued\":\"2026-01-15\",\"validity\":\"1.0\"},{\"chunk_id\":\"acme-dpa#04\",\"content\":\"## Clause 9 — Breach notification\\n\\n9.1 The Processor shall notify the Controller **without undue delay and no later\\nthan 72 hours** after becoming aware of a Personal Data Breach.\",\"doc_id\":\"acme-dpa\",\"fact_type\":\"policy_clause\",\"issued\":\"2026-01-15\",\"validity\":\"1.0\"},{\"chunk_id\":\"acme-pen-test-2026-07#01\",\"content\":\"## Executive summary\\n\\nOne medium-severity finding was identified, corroborating the access-control\\nexception noted in the 2026 SOC 2. No critical or high findings.\",\"doc_id\":\"acme-pen-test-2026-07\",\"fact_type\":\"pen_test\",\"issued\":\"2026-07-15\",\"validity\":\"0.919\"}]}}}],\"role\":\"user\"},{\"parts\":[{\"function_call\":{\"args\":{\"query\":\"acme-dpa\"},\"id\":\"call_1679965\",\"name\":\"search_vendor_evidence\"},\"thought_signature\":\"AY89a18GnA3ZnUbeYcci68QwDIUaEUpLaNhRx8JY-FuNoSFDoK2nFXF1McaIRhkr1xUzYOaMEL6CYPbLlz7Y4QTUHGvxnvTxxmwHnLe3zUzsJ94eQb4-rMAJ1UzXwcl6lAWtduyS79XiYbL8A_WywLlWWlLabf8vEHP-ljMtegVS_vwlaQT9p6Awm6FO85lT0-GsF5gyN0VzzOyqnmBnk3kDcl952G9KJhCC_Yj4Om21qQcxK75mDxXfyOFT9uMISA93CQJj8uAo16rbGlUEHp2bCrr1JVZjI-ixtdxPYomntWMkjv9AHFmMXmrksNM=\"}],\"role\":\"model\"},{\"parts\":[{\"function_response\":{\"id\":\"call_1679965\",\"name\":\"search_vendor_evidence\",\"response\":{\"evidence_node\":\"31a83f97fba6660ff35d9991d4bdf0c437de3ac55a8c0ddfe94c85930d3b0986\",\"pruned_evidence\":[{\"chunk_id\":\"acme-pen-test-2025-02#03\",\"doc_id\":\"acme-pen-test-2025-02\",\"fact_type\":\"pen_test\",\"issued\":\"2025-02-10\",\"validity\":\"0.342\"}],\"pruned_notices\":[\"acme-pen-test-2025-02 (pen_test, issued 2025-02-10) pruned: validity 0.342 < 0.5 — request updated evidence.\"],\"stl_robustness\":\"0.209\",\"stl_satisfied\":true,\"valid_evidence\":[{\"chunk_id\":\"acme-dpa#00\",\"content\":\"# Data Processing Agreement — Acme SaaS Inc.\\n\\n**Effective:** 2026-01-15\",\"doc_id\":\"acme-dpa\",\"fact_type\":\"policy_clause\",\"issued\":\"2026-01-15\",\"validity\":\"1.0\"},{\"chunk_id\":\"acme-vendo