\",\"validity\":\"0.826\"},{\"chunk_id\":\"acme-dpa#00\",\"content\":\"# Data Processing Agreement — Acme SaaS Inc.\\n\\n**Effective:** 2026-01-15\",\"doc_id\":\"acme-dpa\",\"fact_type\":\"policy_clause\",\"issued\":\"2026-01-15\",\"validity\":\"1.0\"},{\"chunk_id\":\"acme-iso-27001#01\",\"content\":\"## Scope of certification\\n\\nThe information security management system (ISMS) supporting the design,\\ndevelopment, and operation of the Acme SaaS platform.\",\"doc_id\":\"acme-iso-27001\",\"fact_type\":\"certification\",\"issued\":\"2025-09-01\",\"validity\":\"0.709\"},{\"chunk_id\":\"acme-soc2-2026#01\",\"content\":\"## Scope\\n\\nThis report covers the Acme SaaS platform, its production infrastructure on a\\nmajor public cloud, and the supporting corporate systems used to develop and\\noperate the service. The examination was performed in accordance with AICPA\\nattestation standards.\",\"doc_id\":\"acme-soc2-2026\",\"fact_type\":\"soc2_report\",\"issued\":\"2026-06-30\",\"validity\":\"0.893\"},{\"chunk_id\":\"acme-vendor-overview#01\",\"content\":\"## Company overview\\n\\nAcme SaaS Inc. provides a workflow-automation platform used by mid-market\\nenterprises. Founded 2019; headquartered in the United States; approximately 180\\nemployees.\",\"doc_id\":\"acme-vendor-overview\",\"fact_type\":\"soc2_report\",\"issued\":\"2026-05-20\",\"validity\":\"0.826\"}]}}}],\"role\":\"user\"}],\"model\":\"gemini-3.5-flash\"}",
      "result": "{\"response\":{\"content\":{\"parts\":[{\"text\":\"[\\n  {\\n    \\\"control\\\": \\\"DPA §7.1\\\",\\n    \\\"severity\\\": \\\"medium\\\",\\n    \\\"rationale\\\": \\\"The DPA commits to implementing appropriate technical and organizational measures and access controls (Clause 7.1), but the SOC 2 report (acme-soc2-2026) reveals a logical access control exception where MFA is not enforced on the legacy customer tier.\\\",\\n    \\\"policy_clause\\\": \\\"Clause 7.1 (Technical and Organizational Security Measures)\\\",\\n    \\\"evidence_node\\\": \\\"8ae6499bd7a857b45e2c911eda407e539b5a0e5c4d793fc4d5b734053e24108d\\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n    \\\"control\\\": \\\"DPA §5.1\\\",\\n    \\\"severity\\\": \\\"low\\\",\\n    \\\"rationale\\\": \\\"While Clause 5.1 of the DPA states that the Processor maintains a current list of subprocessors, the list itself was not provided in the reviewed materials to verify compliance with the US/EU data residency restrictions in Clause 4.1.\\\",\\n    \\\"policy_clause\\\": \\\"Clause 5.1 (Subprocessor List Maintenance)\\\",\\n    \\\"evidence_node\\\": \\\"6b2e0019cf0e1c9e3ec2b377d30cda4f6314be5a00eb10ff0ab9296b525959a7\\\"\\n  }\\n]\",\"thought_signature\":\"AY89a1_AtWwFe1jTJeQkG4m7XUFSy_fSXt3bZEblFdqAxue0hCAcBHH_DyQE3TjEQv3i4g4jPtjQJsdgP1uWl1KYNHfYGsf6R0wrQjHhvL169IBOqxg7xxDzFt8NmccCA8Vbu0HdfFeEmpXexl0AV44r1xQhjmok-NGDn4r6KYDrSkO5beuVcYrT7EAKI9nmEzJjeHeHmVEZzn9nRvNbYVkNhGjdl7Z4M4JORwovH35UrFgX3Yz6PbBaA1cVZPxmDlv56pvXj1kVoQHvA8-R-2ymjUiROKB1XWTtL4PMVQUTurmjwUzmZ91vCgo7lyfjxRt2EppatUVfqGp1a-x-c3RhjCW3WvviP-y3zJ7SN8cifBfeutt8G6VXolcZzl3_DcJsBJI37mCjapiWfil3tat2zGFoz8S0T9VjWdTfvZTIyTgCZzMj7rUMrycqKTvd8diLBULn7ePGHUMotoEjsksPgkT_g3zbPxnDxleZLdMtp4e4J8emX1c_FN5SCG-khTFopCSG7PVtC60Htos813qU0GAyCc_jbmPjDVxlvqbvWAjnJQC6HaGnx3c0Qsq_oNVIEitpAhUnUuYFe69Y72BOHAKc7v6CBpLaeVg4M_6__-aJwtlRcwpR5YV9nQFnURpdToQgGp9UViNeOinlwzA9uCEwCEo9pu-wEejjB17WCaRCCDYqwMvbwx0sX35FovrxLS1RKBVJjiAtdP2hRBZGgALmASNHsfrO24XYbdreKWSzLSj_dc86oDjIsBO9Lmo2ZEaFZd